sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant App as ZENApplication
    participant NapariUI as StreamingViewer UI
    participant ZENConnection as ZEN Connection
    participant StatusMonitor as Status Monitor
    participant StreamPipeline as Stream Pipeline
    participant Viewer as Napari Viewer
    participant RestructureTask as Restructure Task
    participant OmeZarr as stream_to_omezarr_with_config

    App->>ZENConnection: Initialize connection + services

    alt ZEN_UI_START=true (monitoring mode)
        App->>NapariUI: Create selector UI and populate experiments

        alt Mode = Display only
            App->>StreamPipeline: monitor_all_experiments()

            alt Start from napari button
                User->>NapariUI: Select experiment & click Start
                NapariUI->>NapariUI: Hide start button / clear old layers
                NapariUI->>ZENConnection: start_experiment(name)
                ZENConnection-->>NapariUI: experiment_id
                NapariUI->>NapariUI: Show stop button
                NapariUI->>StatusMonitor: Start status monitor task
                StatusMonitor->>ZENConnection: monitor_all_experiments()
                ZENConnection-->>StatusMonitor: Frame/status stream
                Note over StatusMonitor: Polls is_experiment_running flag
            else Start from ZEN Blue
                User->>ZENConnection: Start experiment in ZEN Blue
                Note over NapariUI: No current_experiment_id in UI
            end

            loop For each frame
                StreamPipeline->>StreamPipeline: Extract FramePosition S,T,M,Z,C
                StreamPipeline->>Viewer: add_frame(image, metadata)

                alt First frame of new acquisition
                    Viewer->>Viewer: Clear old layers and reset frame data
                end

                Viewer->>Viewer: Cancel pending restructure task
                Viewer->>Viewer: Store under sparse key (S,T,M,Z,C)
                Viewer->>Viewer: Update last_frame_time
                Viewer->>Viewer: Update 7D streaming layer (S,T,M,Z,C,Y,X)
                Viewer->>RestructureTask: Start new check task

                alt current_experiment_id exists
                    RestructureTask->>RestructureTask: Wait indefinitely
                    Note over RestructureTask: Status monitor triggers restructure
                else No current_experiment_id
                    RestructureTask->>RestructureTask: Wait timeout (default 10.0s)
                end
            end

            alt User clicks Stop in napari
                User->>NapariUI: Click Stop button
                NapariUI->>NapariUI: _close_progress_bar()
                NapariUI->>ZENConnection: stop_experiment(experiment_id)
                NapariUI->>Viewer: perform_restructure()
            else Completion via status monitor
                ZENConnection->>StatusMonitor: is_experiment_running = false
                StatusMonitor->>Viewer: perform_restructure()
            else Completion via timeout
                RestructureTask->>RestructureTask: Timeout elapsed with no new frames
                RestructureTask->>Viewer: perform_restructure()
            end

            Viewer->>Viewer: Set is_streaming = false
            Viewer->>Viewer: Remove 7D streaming layer

            loop For each channel
                Viewer->>Viewer: Build 6D array (S,T,M,Z,Y,X)
                Viewer->>Viewer: Create channel layer
            end

            Viewer->>Viewer: Set axis labels (S,T,M,Z,Y,X)

            Note over NapariUI: Channel filter (Display only, any time)
            User->>NapariUI: Change Channel filter combo box
            NapariUI->>NapariUI: Update _effective_channel_index
            NapariUI->>StreamPipeline: suspend_reader() + resume_reader()
            Note over StreamPipeline: New gRPC stream opens with updated channel_index

        else Mode = OME-ZARR only
            User->>NapariUI: Select experiment & click Start
            NapariUI->>NapariUI: Validate selected experiment
            NapariUI->>ZENConnection: Use cached or load/export experiment metadata
            ZENConnection-->>NapariUI: T,C,Z,S,M, Z spacing, well positions
            NapariUI->>NapariUI: Build ecfg from UI settings and exported XML
            NapariUI->>StreamPipeline: suspend_reader() before opening writer stream
            NapariUI->>OmeZarr: stream_to_omezarr_with_config(ecfg)
            OmeZarr->>OmeZarr: Create dedicated gRPC channel
            OmeZarr->>OmeZarr: Open one pixel stream per source channel

            alt Auto-trigger checked (default)
                OmeZarr->>ZENConnection: start_experiment(name)
                ZENConnection-->>OmeZarr: experiment_id
            else Auto-trigger unchecked
                Note over NapariUI: Button shows "Writer Armed — start ZEN Experiment"
                User->>ZENConnection: Start experiment manually in ZEN Blue
            end

            OmeZarr->>OmeZarr: Wait for first frame to get frame size and scale
            OmeZarr->>ZENConnection: get_status()
            ZENConnection-->>OmeZarr: Live T,C,Z,S,M counts
            Note over OmeZarr: Positive live counts define valid ranges
            Note over OmeZarr: Exported XML dimensions are fallback
            OmeZarr->>OmeZarr: Build expected map in T,S,M,C,Z append order

            loop For each frame (tight while-True loop)
                OmeZarr->>OmeZarr: Read frame from gRPC stream
                OmeZarr->>OmeZarr: Read T,S,M,Z from FramePosition and C from subscription
                OmeZarr->>OmeZarr: Map key (T,S,M,C,Z) to linear slot
                alt Unexpected or duplicate key
                    OmeZarr->>OmeZarr: Skip frame
                else New expected key
                    OmeZarr->>OmeZarr: Capture streamed XYZ/scale for (S,M)
                    OmeZarr->>OmeZarr: Buffer by slot and append consecutive slots
                end
                alt All unique expected keys received
                    OmeZarr->>OmeZarr: Break
                end
            end

            OmeZarr->>OmeZarr: Drain pending frames and skip missing slots
            OmeZarr->>OmeZarr: Close OME-Zarr stream
            alt Explicit HCS metadata
                OmeZarr->>OmeZarr: Finalize directly written well images and HCS row groups
            else Generic multiple S or M
                OmeZarr->>OmeZarr: Group raw tiles by streamed S index
                OmeZarr->>OmeZarr: Identify each raw tile by streamed M index
                OmeZarr->>OmeZarr: Place using streamed XYZ and pixel scale
                OmeZarr->>OmeZarr: Higher M replaces overlaps and gaps remain
                OmeZarr->>OmeZarr: Advertise one TCZYX mosaic per scene
            end
            OmeZarr-->>NapariUI: Return zarr_path
        end

    else ZEN_UI_START=false (auto-start mode)
        App->>ZENConnection: start_experiment(config.exp_name)
        ZENConnection-->>App: experiment_id
        App->>StreamPipeline: monitor_experiment(experiment_id)
        Note over NapariUI: No UI-start status monitor task
    end

    NapariUI->>NapariUI: on_experiment_finished()
    NapariUI->>NapariUI: _close_progress_bar()
    NapariUI->>NapariUI: Show start button + hide stop button
    NapariUI->>StatusMonitor: Cancel monitoring task
    NapariUI->>NapariUI: Clear current_experiment_id

    Note over User,NapariUI: Ready for next acquisition
